# disc-bdj-menu: arrows move the focus between the three buttons, Enter on Play starts playlist 00000.
# MenuXlet plays playlist 00001 behind its menu and shows the menu once it has started.
wait still 1000   # the menu, Play focused (its first paint may come before playlist 00001's event, so no playlist wait)
key down          # Chapters
wait still 1000
key down          # Extras
wait still 1000
key up            # Chapters
wait still 1000
key up            # Play
wait still 1000
key ok            # Play: the menu closes and playlist 00000 starts
wait playlist 0
